      "type": "ShadPasswordInput",
      "name": "ShadPasswordInput",
      "description": "Password input with a show/hide eye button (showToggle) and an optional strength meter (showStrength: a three-part weak/fair/strong bar under the box, exposed as strength = '' | 'weak' | 'fair' | 'strong'). Validate with the text rules (mandatory, regex, min length). Height: 64px with a label (label above the control), 36px without; add 24px for help text or a validation message; the strength meter adds 16px",
